---
onetaskgraph_template: 1
description: >-
  The plan that answers people's comments on follow-up tickets through onefollowup: gather
  the comments to answer, run one feedback plan per owning batch, and settle every answer.
  `just follow-ups-answer-comments` creates it and runs it in a flow.
variables:
  project:
    description: The plan's native id, which every member's own id is prefixed with.
    type: string
    required: true
members:
  - id: "{{ project }}-gather"
    title: "Gather the follow-up comments to answer"
    template: {file: follow-up-step.md.j2}
    answers: {step: "List each destination's comments since its watermark with `onefollowup comments gather`, and select each one to answer for the batch owning its item."}
    metadata:
      onepipeline.id: gather
      onepipeline.kind: command
      onepipeline.command: [just, follow-ups-answer-comments, --gather]
  - id: "{{ project }}-answer"
    title: "Answer the gathered comments, one feedback run per owning batch"
    template: {file: follow-up-step.md.j2}
    answers: {step: "For each batch `onefollowup comments launches` names, create its feedback plan and run it attached in this flow."}
    depends_on: ["{{ project }}-gather"]
    metadata:
      onepipeline.id: answer
      onepipeline.kind: command
      onepipeline.command: [just, follow-ups-answer-comments, --answer]
  - id: "{{ project }}-settle"
    title: "Settle the answered comments"
    template: {file: follow-up-step.md.j2}
    answers: {step: "Verify every reply, send every ticket change and move the watermark with `onefollowup comments settle`."}
    depends_on: ["{{ project }}-answer"]
    metadata:
      onepipeline.id: settle
      onepipeline.kind: command
      onepipeline.command: [just, follow-ups-answer-comments, --settle]
---
Answer people's comments on this host's follow-up tickets, once each, through onefollowup.
